<title>UK: TABLE-GKN H1 profit up 12.2 pct despite stg.</title>
<headline>TABLE-GKN H1 profit up 12.2 pct despite stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 28</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		38.9		   vs 31.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 10.5		   vs 9.6</p>
<p> Pretax		     203		    vs 181</p>
<p> Turnover		   1.687 bln	    vs 1.726 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 185 and 193 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - GKN Plc.</p>
<p>NOTE - The negative impact of the strong pound on GKN's profits was 18 million stg, above the 10 million stg originally predicted by the company in May.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
</text>
